  "description": "HIDYUR crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C134 H138 Gd4 N18 O16. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.636-3.913 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.42-112.03°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C134H138N18O16Gd4.",
